# GitHub example. Replace example team names with actual repository teams.
# Enable required code-owner review and protect the required CI job itself.
/driver_lint/                 @your-org/driver-lint-maintainers
/driver_lint/pablo_is/        @your-org/pablo-is-maintainers
/driver_lint/gdc/             @your-org/gdc-maintainers
/exynos/external-modules/camera/ @your-org/pablo-is-maintainers
/exynos/external-modules/camera/camera/post/gdc/ @your-org/gdc-maintainers
/exynos/external-modules/camera/camera/testing/kunit/post/*gdc* @your-org/gdc-maintainers
# Shared build/board metadata needs both responsibilities represented in review.
# GitHub accepts approval from any listed owner. Requiring both teams needs
# additional review-server rules; listing two teams alone does not enforce it.
/exynos/external-modules/camera/BUILD.bazel @your-org/pablo-is-maintainers @your-org/gdc-maintainers
/exynos/external-modules/camera/camera/Kconfig @your-org/pablo-is-maintainers @your-org/gdc-maintainers
/exynos/external-modules/camera/camera/post/Makefile @your-org/pablo-is-maintainers @your-org/gdc-maintainers
/exynos/device/erd/erd9965/arch/arm64/configs/*.fragment @your-org/pablo-is-maintainers @your-org/gdc-maintainers
/.claude/                    @your-org/driver-lint-maintainers
/.codex/                     @your-org/driver-lint-maintainers
/.opencode/                  @your-org/driver-lint-maintainers
/CLAUDE.md                   @your-org/driver-lint-maintainers
/AGENTS.md                   @your-org/driver-lint-maintainers
/.github/                    @your-org/driver-lint-maintainers
/.gitlab-ci.yml              @your-org/driver-lint-maintainers
/Jenkinsfile                 @your-org/driver-lint-maintainers
# Later matching entries override earlier ones. Put repository-specific CI
# paths and CODEOWNERS ownership here when adapting to your hosting platform.
